"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Reins\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Reins_6b1521.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Wolf Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wolf_Trophy_8a9152.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Guardian Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Guardian_Shield_1a3c3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Necrotic Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Necrotic_Rod_0832d7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Decay\"><img alt=\"Wand of Decay\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Decay_908d54.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.10<br/>December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>A new tower introduced in the Winter Update 2007. It is inhabited by many dark creatures led by a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Magician\">Dark Magician</a> and is located north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32502,32041,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32502, 32041, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>Just to the right of the tower there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sundial\">Sundial</a>. The walls of the tower are snake walls and stone snake walls. There are also a few Armillary Spheres in and on the tower. It seems like the regular <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">wolves</a> won't go too close to the tower.  On the first floor there hang wall chains. On the second floor there is a table with a Potion Stand of <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood\">blood</a> and a Test-Tube Holder of urine.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in Magician Tower: Ground Floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\"><img alt=\"War Wolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/War_Wolf_6ce311.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">55</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">140</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Warwolf Fur (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Paw\">Wolf Paw</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\">Wolf Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>On the ground floor there are 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolfs</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in Magician Tower: Floor 1</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max