Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Dragonbreath\">Wand of Dragonbreath</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Decay\">Wand of Decay</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Reins (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>On the first floor there is 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentices</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in Magician Tower: Floor 2</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\"><img alt=\"Ghoul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghoul_8f4d49.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">85</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">97 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">27 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></